    "text": "Columns 1, 2 and 3 contain conics, equations of tangents to the conics and points of contact, respectively.<table border=\"1\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>Column 1</td>\t\t\t<td>Column 2</td>\t\t\t<td>Column 3</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(I) <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(i) <math><mi>m</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(P) <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(II) <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(ii) <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(Q) <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(III) <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(iii) <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(R) <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(IV) <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(iv) <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(S) <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table>The tangent to a suitable conic (Column 1) at <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is found to be <math><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> , then which of the following options is the only Correct combination?",
