  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi></math>&nbsp;tangent&nbsp;<math><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>,&nbsp;comparing with (II)</p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#160;</mi></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;is tangent for&nbsp;<math><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;i.e. (ii)</p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Point of contact for&nbsp;<math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is R</p>",
